course: dictionary
lesson: 8578
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Many words have more than one meaning, and school is one of them. The words around it tell you which meaning the writer means. Read the whole sentence before you decide.
explain: «In Ohio, a teacher hands Everett a note in front of everyone saying his family owes $12 for school lunches.» Here school means a place. The lunches are served there, and a teacher is handing out the note there.
explain: «Hammerhead sharks have wide heads... some gather in big schools near islands.» Here a school is a large group of animals swimming together. The clue is gather near islands: a school of sharks is not a building.
explain: School can also be casual slang. «She schooled him at chess» means she beat him easily, and «old school» means in the old style, often cool. If a building or a group does not fit the sentence, the word is probably being used in a new way.
fact: A school is a place where children go to learn.
fact: School can also mean the time you spend learning there, as in «after school».
fact: A school of fish is a large group of fish swimming together.
fact: In the USA, «school» can mean college or university.
fact: «Skip school», «wag» (Australia, NZ), «mitch» (Ireland) and «play hooky» (USA) all mean missing school without permission.
exercise: «Some gather in big schools near islands.» What does school mean here? | A place where children go to learn | A part of a university | The time you spend learning | *A large group of animals swimming together
exercise: «In Ohio, a teacher hands Everett a note saying his family owes $12 for school lunches.» What does school mean in «school lunches»? | A group of fish | *A place where children go to learn | A university in the USA | A slang word for beating someone
exercise: «She schooled him at chess.» What does schooled mean here? | Played chess with him after school | *Beat him easily | Gave him a school prize | Taught him a lesson in a classroom
test: «Ella skipped school to play in the park.» What does skipped school mean? | Joined a school of fish | *Missed school without permission | Went to college | Read a book in the school library
test: «We play football after school.» What does after school mean? | *The time after lessons end | Before the first lesson of the day | A place where children learn | A group of students
exam: The sentence «The number of pupils enrolled at the school rose during the academic year» uses school in which sense? | A large group of fish | Old style, often cool | *A place of learning, an educational institution | To beat someone easily
